00:07:26.919 --> 00:07:30.919
that exists which is beyond

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:33.440
the physical.

00:07:30.919 --> 00:07:35.720
>> I don't I wouldn't say it entails it,

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:38.080
but I think we have reason to think that

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:40.280
everything is physical. Everything Maybe

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:42.360
I should put it ultimately physical. I

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:44.680
mean, I you know, it's important to

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:47.160
distinguish between

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.560
what is sometimes called elimination.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.320
>> Mhm.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.920
>> Uh, you know, we think that, uh,

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.800
you know, people used to think there was

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:55.960
a luminiferous ether. They used to think

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.960
that, um,

00:07:55.960 --> 00:08:00.080
uh, heat phenomena are explained by some

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.360
substance called phlogiston.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:04.200
>> Mhm.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:05.680
>> So, we have eliminated those entities,

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.080
that is, we don't believe in them

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:09.720
anymore.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:11.720
Um, but, um, uh,

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:14.360
uh, we do believe, even though we now

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:17.600
have found out that heat is molecular

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:19.160
kinetic energy, we don't say heat is

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:21.560
there is no heat.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:24.600
We just have found out what it is in

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:27.560
physical terms. And the same with, um,

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:29.720
light. Uh, we found out that light is

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:33.520
electromagnetic radiation of a certain

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:35.680
frequency, um, frequency band, and we

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:38.280
don't think there is no light. So,

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:40.960
that's reduction. Sometimes you would

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:43.640
use the term reduction to describe that.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:46.280
Um, so, um,

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.960
I wouldn't So, I think we have reason to

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:50.440
think, I'm not saying it's a necessary

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:53.560
truth or anything, that everything that

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:54.640
exists is physical or reducible to the

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:57.120
physical.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:58.880
>> And so, the opposite of dualism, or or

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:00.680
the or the counterpoint to dualism, is

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:02.720
often presented as monism, and a lot of

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:04.160
people see monism as being associated

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:06.360
with physicalism, but of course there is

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:09.120
another kind of monism,

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:12.040
which is idealism, which is the other

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:14.200
extreme, where everything is mind stuff.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:16.560
