00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:35.880
>> Yeah, so I think that the motivating

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:39.040
impulse behind idealism, uh, confuses

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.800
epistemology with metaphysics.

