00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.880
>> Mhm.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:08.520
Okay, so so you so you don't have much

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:10.200
truck with the whole

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:12.400
radical doubt idea that we can't ever

